System LLVM 23 has no AMDGPU::getFeatureBitset, getLocalMemorySize,
or the VGPR/SGPR GPUKind helpers comgr 10.2 calls. xnack and sramecc
come from getArchAttrAMDGCN. SGPR counts come from getIsaVersion.
The other ISA fields are the 10.1 published table, including EUsPerCU
4 and MaxWavesPerCU 40. gfx13-generic falls back to the gfx1310 row.

